variable name	unit	data type	category	variable description
"1_authors"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"name of the 1st author of the publication"
"1_year"	"n_a"	"numerical"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"year of publication"
"1_experimentation_id"	"n_a"	"numerical"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"number of the experiment described in the publication, the maximum is 8 experiments in the same publication"
"1_latitude"	"n_a"	"numerical"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"geographic coordinate of the east-west position of each experimental site, relative to the Greenwich meridian"
"1_longitude"	"n_a"	"numerical"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"geographical coordinate of the north-south position of each experimental site, relative to the Equator"
"1_first_effect_tested"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"first effect tested was the one declared by the authors of each publication. The authors of the 90 annotated publications declared that they had tested one of the following 25 effects: access time, animal physiological stage, animal species, day of grazing, density bulk, density of patch, density of stems, density of tillers, feeding system, fertilization, forage allowance, forage phenological stage, forage regrowth stage, forage species, grazing cycle, grazing down stages, individual, localization, measurement time, season, stocking rate, supplementation, sward height, tillage method and time of day."
"1_first_effect_tested_modality"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"modality indicated for each treatment of each first effect tested within each experiment"
"1_second_effect_tested"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"second effect tested as declared by the authors of each publication, among the 25 effects detailed above (cf. first effect)"
"1_second_effect_tested_modality"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"modalities indicated for each treatment of each second effect tested within each experiment"
"1_third_effect_tested"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"third effect tested as declared by the authors of each publication, among the 25 effects detailed above (cf. first effect)"
"1_third_effect_tested_modality"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"modalities indicated for each treatment of each third effect tested within each experiment"
"1_experimentation_with_artificial_sward"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"3 levels: artificial microsward, microplots or natural pasture"
"1_feeding_behaviour_measurement_method"	"n_a"	"character"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"3 levels: observation, recorders, accelerometers"
"1_measurement_duration"	"hour"	"numerical"	"encoding/experimental characteristics"	"the duration of visual observation or recording, using recorders or accelerometers "
"2_small_ruminant_type"	"n_a"	"numerical"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"2 levels: 1 if sheep or goats, 0 otherwise"
"2_livestock_type"	"n_a"	"character"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"5 types of cattle (cattle, calf, heifer, steer, cow), 3 types of sheep (sheep, ewe,lamb), goat and n_a"
"2_animal_species"	"n_a"	"character"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"stated species name"
"2_age"	"month"	"numerical"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"evaluated average age per group of animal"
"2_bodyweight"	"kg"	"numerical"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"average measured bodyweight per group of animal"
"2_incisive_arcade"	"cm"	"numerical"	"animal morphological traits/animal charcateristics"	"arc length from right incisor to left incisor"
"3_forage_species"	"n_a"	"character"	"sward characteristics"	"name of the dominant forage species"
"3_forage_dry_matter_mass"	"kg DM/ha"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"total forage dry matter (DM) mass produced per ha"
"3_sward_height_before_grazing"	"cm"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"the height of the sward before grazing by the ruminants"
"3_herbage_bulk_density"	"kg DM/m3"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"apparent density of forage per m3, being the ratio of total forage dry matter (DM) mass and of average sward height"
"3_forage_allowance"	"% of BW"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"amount of forage in dry matter available per animal per day"
"3_forage_leaf_mass"	"kg DM/ha"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"leaf dry matter (DM) mass"
"3_forage_stem_mass"	"kg DM/ha"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"stem dry matter (DM) mass"
"3_dead_material_mass"	"% of DM"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"mass of debris in dry matter (DM)"
"3_crude_protein_content"	"% of DM"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"total feed protein content, as a percentage of dry matter (DM)"
"3_neutral_detergent_fiber_content"	"% of DM"	"numerical"	"sward characteristics"	"neutral detergent fiber content, as a percentage of dry matter (DM)"
"4_bite_area"	"cm2"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"bite area is calculated by dividing the defoliation area, by the total number of bites made for the same area"
"4_bite_depth"	"cm"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"bite depth, indicates the grazed sward height, calculated by difference of the height before and after grazing"
"4_bite_volume_liter"	"liter"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"volume of a bite calculated assuming that the bite has the shape of a cylinder of given depth and area, the product of which is the volume of the bite"
"4_bite_volume_by_bodyweight"	"ml/kg BW"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"volume of a bite calculated as above, divided by bodyweight (BW)"
"4_bite_mass"	"g DM"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the amount of dry matter (DM) taken from a single bite"
"4_bite_mass_by_bodyweight"	"g DM/kg BW"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the amount of dry matter (DM) taken from a single bite and calculated per kg of bodyweight (BW)"
"4_bite_duration"	"s"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the duration of a bite in seconds, calculated as the ratio of the duration of grazing by the total number of bites made"
"4_biting_rate"	"n/min"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the number of bites made per minute of grazing"
"4_bite_number_per_dry_matter_intake"	"n/g DMI"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the number of bites made per minute of grazing, calculated per kg of dry matter intake (DMI)"
"4_daily_number_of_bites"	"n/day"	"numerical"	"bite characteristics/bite items"	"the total number of bites per day, calculated as the product of biting_rate, by grazing_time"
"4_chews_frequency"	"n/min"	"numerical"	"jaw characteristics"	"the number of chew made per minute of grazing"
"4_chews_number_per_bite"	"n/bite"	"numerical"	"jaw characteristics"	"the number of chew made per bite"
"4_jaw_movement_number_per_dry_matter_intake"	"n/g DMI"	"numerical"	"jaw characteristics"	"number of jaw movements per gram of dry matter intake (DMI)"
"4_jaw_movement_number_per_bite"	"n/bite"	"numerical"	"jaw characteristics"	"number of jaw movements per bite"
"4_jaw_movement_frequency"	"n/min"	"numerical"	"jaw characteristics"	"the number of jaw movements (=chews + bites), per minute of chewing"
"5_rumination_time"	"min/day"	"numerical"	"time budget"	"the duration of  idling  in minute estimated for 24h"
"5_grazing_time"	"min/day"	"numerical"	"time budget"	"the duration of the grazing activity in minute estimated for 24h"
"5_idling_time"	"min/day"	"numerical"	"time budget"	"the duration of the rumination activity in minute, estimated for 24h"
"6_dry_matter_intake_by_bodyweight"	"% DMI/BW"	"numerical"	"intake"	"dry matter intake (DMI) per day per kg of bodyweight (BW)"
"6_intake_rate"	"g DMI/min"	"numerical"	"intake"	"dry matter intake (DMI) per minute of grazing"
"6_intake_rate_by_bodyweight"	"mg DMI/min/kg BW"	"numerical"	"intake"	"dry matter intake (DMI) per minute of grazing per kg of bodyweight (BW)"
